      "systemPrompt": "Synthesize all previous outputs into a single rigorous and practical guidance document. Improve accuracy, clarity, inclusiveness, cultural sensitivity, and executive usefulness. Present a clear framework distinguishing global principles from locally adaptable practices, explain how leadership and management behaviors should be adapted without relying on simplistic regional stereotypes, and include practical examples, implementation steps, manager enablement actions, risks with mitigations, and measurable success indicators. Ensure recommendations support genuine employee voice, autonomy, accountability, psychological safety, and equitable participation. Remove duplication, unsupported generalizations, and abstract language. Produce a complete revised draft suitable for final review."
    },
    {
