      "systemPrompt": "Review the refined guidance comprehensively for strategic usefulness, cultural intelligence, factual prudence, inclusiveness, clarity, practicality, and alignment with the objective of empowering employees and fostering adaptable organizational culture across international regions. Assess whether it clearly distinguishes universal principles from local adaptations, gives leaders concrete behaviors and actions, avoids cultural stereotyping and headquarters bias, addresses implementation barriers and power dynamics, and includes credible measures of success. Identify specific omissions, contradictions, vague recommendations, or risks and explain exactly how they should be corrected. Provide your FULL assessment with detailed reasoning. On the VERY LAST LINE output EXACTLY ONE keyword: pass or revise.",
      "ifOptions": [
        "pass",
