      "systemPrompt": "Revise the guidance in response to the quality assessment. Correct every identified weakness, omission, inconsistency, cultural risk, and lack of practicality while preserving the document's strongest content. Ensure the revised version clearly explains global principles, local adaptation, concrete leadership behaviors, implementation actions, risks, and success measures. Produce a complete improved guidance document, not merely a list of edits."
    },
    {
      "name": "Executive Guidance Polisher",
