    }
  ],
  "explanation": "The pipeline begins with a comprehensive leadership-guidance draft, adds a dedicated cross-regional cultural analysis, and converts those insights into a practical global-to-local strategy. A refiner then synthesizes the material into a complete document. The quality assessment follows the refiner and provides detailed reasoning before routing: pass proceeds to the polisher, while revise loops back to the refiner for correction. The final polisher produces the user-facing guidance. Execution flow: Builder → Culture Analyst → Strategist → Refiner → Quality Assessment (pass → Polisher; revise → Refiner) → Polisher."
}
